QuestGuidance.Register("es",274,{
[8737]="7005985C\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: Enemigos en la Puerta Este'\tYour mission is to defeat the Pûlpum gate-captain and Orcs camped at the East-gate of Moria. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to the Dimrill Dale.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8738]="700583EB\n1\tDerrota a los trolls de asedio de Gundabad en Ashmâr-zarakh (total: 3)\tTu misión es derrotar a los trolls de asedio de Ashmâr-zarakh.\n",
[8739]="70058422\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: Motores de carne y piedra'\tYour mission is to defeat the siege-trolls of Ashmâr-zarakh. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Ashmâr-zarakh.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8740]="70070CD3\n1\tComplete Mission: Enough Problems Already\tYour mission is to travel to Mokh Grazádh to the west and thin the number of Orcs in the camp before they continue to attack Laivárth. If you can, destroy any supplies you come across as well. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully thinned the numbers within the Orc's ranks and hurt their supplies. That should ensure that Laivárth is safe for now.\n",
[8741]="70071DFC\n1\tComplete Mission: Escape from the Palace\tYour mission is travel to the Hall of Lajór in Zajâna and free the nobles taken prisoner by the Jewelled Council. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have freed the Zajâni nobles and gotten them safely out of the Hall of Lajór. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[8742]="70071DF8\n1\tComplete Mission: Everything Goes Boom\tYour mission is journey to Glúkroz and defeat the goblins encamped there and set fire to their weapons of war. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have defeated the goblin war-leader and destroyed their weapons of war. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[8743]="7006D1C4\n1\tComplete Mission: Eviction Notice\tYour mission is to clear the Ordâkhai from their camp north of Iridír. You should defeat the Ordâkhai and burn their tents. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to get started.\n2\tSpeak with Khâdamul in Iridír\tYou have defeated the Ordâkhai, burned their tents, and bested their champion. Return with Khâdamul to report your success.\n",
[8744]="7005894D\n1\tReclama el camino hacia Grálinvarth\tTu misión es asegurar Grálinvarth como base para los Gabil'akkâ en el Valle Ancestral.\n2\tReclama el vado del Greylin\tTu misión es asegurar Grálinvarth como base para los Gabil'akkâ en el Valle Ancestral.\n3\tReclama las altas cataratas del Greylin\tTu misión es asegurar Grálinvarth como base para los Gabil'akkâ en el Valle Ancestral.\n4\tReclama Grálinvarth\tTu misión es asegurar Grálinvarth como base para los Gabil'akkâ en el Valle Ancestral.\n",
[8745]="70058969\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: Ojos en el Valle Ancestral'\tYour mission is to secure Grálinvarth as a foothold for the Gabil'akkâ in Elderslade. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Grálinvarth.\n2\tHabla con Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8746]="7006C12D\n1\tComplete Mission: Fashionable Thievery\tYour mission is to go to Ghât Okho and recover the helms the crebain so brazenly stole. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have successfully retrieved the headwear! Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8747]="70072F7D\n1\tComplete Mission: Fell Summoning\tYour mission is to prevent the kergrim from befouling the Tombs of Khâb Ishil and using it as a conduit to summon fell spirits into the world! Find a way to disrupt the ritual and end this menace.\n2\tSpeak with Shâpar in Ahaba\tYou have prevented the kergrim from befouling the Tombs of Khâb Ishil, and stopped their ploy to summon fell spirits into the world!\n",
[8748]="70070CFF\n1\tComplete Mission: Flies in the Marsh\tTu misión es viajar a Saig Hathíl y reducir el número de moscas guadaña que se han vuelto peligrosas y agresivas.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully thinned the numbers of sickle-flies in Saig Hathíl. It should be safe for travellers once again.\n",
[8749]="70062D12\n1\tCompleta la miniaventura: Hora del Festín\tPor orden del capataz de Pie de Gram, debes dirigirte a Escarchahueca y masacrar a los hobbits para comer.\n2\tRegresa con Uglash en Pie de Gram\tHas masacrado bien a esos hobbits asquerosos. Ahora regresa con Uglash y cuéntale lo que has hecho.\n",
[8750]="7005CACE\n1\tAtiende a los Barbiluengos heridos (total: 8)\030Derrota a los dragonzuelos (total: 10)\030¡Desafía a los enanos para renovar su determinación! (total: 8)\tAyuda a los enanos Barbiluengos a resistir el ataque de los dragonzuelos de escarcha.\n2\tBaja la ladera de la montaña.\t\n",
[8751]="7005CAD0\n1\tComplete Mission: Frosty Reception\tYour mission is to defend Erebor from a Frost-horde assault. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8752]="700585AB\n1\tAcércarte sigilosamente a los trasgos\t\n2\tAyuda a los trasgos a emborracharse (total: 4)\030Distrae a los trasgos señalando con el dedo (total: 2)\030Distrae a los trasgos diciendo adiós con la mano (total: 2)\tDerrota a los trasgos en Stramvárth.\n3\tDerrota al líder trasgo\tDerrota al líder trasgo.\n4\tBaila con el líder trasgo\030Ejecuta otro baile con el líder trasgo\030Ejecuta el segundo tipo de baile con el líder trasgo\030Ejecuta el tercer tipo de baile con el líder trasgo\tBaila con el líder trasgo.\n",
[8753]="700585B6\n1\tComplete Mission: Goblins at Stramvárth\tYour mission is to ambush a group of raiders camped at Stramvárth for the night. Speak to Hórin to travel to Stramvárth.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8754]="7005A817\n1\tEntra en la cámara\tEntra en la cámara.\n2\tRecupera los tesoros (total: 20)\030Recupera los tesoros valiosos (total: 4)\030Recupera los tesoros de valor incalculable (total: 2)\030¡Sal de la cámara después de recuperar el tesoro!\t¡Recupera el tesoro y sal de la cámara antes de que se cierre la puerta! Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n",
[8755]="7005A82A\n1\tComplete Mission: Gold Rush\tYour mission is to collect treasures from a recently uncovered dwarf-vault in Gundabad. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8756]="7005A825\n1\tDestruye las barricadas de hielo (total: 10)\030Derrota a los dragonzuelos (total: 10)\tDebes derrotar a los dragonzuelos frío y sus gélidas barricadas.\n2\tDerrota a Hártung\tDebes derrotar a Hártung.\n",
